WEBVTT

00:43.877 --> 00:45.462
Well, I'm sure it's obvious.

00:46.046 --> 00:47.922
He's the one who liked me first.

00:50.133 --> 00:51.426
That's what she said?

00:52.552 --> 00:53.678
Is she sick or something?

00:53.762 --> 00:58.099
Well, Ung still followed me around
after the documentary had ended.

00:58.183 --> 01:01.311
So here's what I believe,
he asked me out first.

01:02.896 --> 01:05.231
God, I should've snapped out of it
and ran away

01:05.315 --> 01:06.983
when she threw herself at me.

01:08.526 --> 01:10.695
Hmm. I'm not sure.

01:10.779 --> 01:12.781
It's so vague, so I can't really tell.

01:12.864 --> 01:15.992
It's not a special memory
worth remembering.

01:16.076 --> 01:18.119
She doesn't remember?

01:18.203 --> 01:19.871
Wow, unbelievable.

01:20.497 --> 01:22.457
I remember it clearly, you know.

01:22.540 --> 01:25.877
It was that fated day
when everything had gone south.

01:30.799 --> 01:33.343
It was the final day
of the documentary shooting.

01:34.052 --> 01:35.678
Oh, it's raining cats and dogs.

01:35.762 --> 01:37.847
How come it wasn't announced
in the forecast?

01:37.931 --> 01:39.140
So how's your camera?

01:39.224 --> 01:40.350
It's working fine.

01:41.101 --> 01:44.187
Problem is, the battery's dead.

01:44.270 --> 01:45.230
What?

01:45.313 --> 01:48.108
Too bad, this is the best place
to end our shooting.

01:49.734 --> 01:52.362
By the looks of it,
I'm sure it's just a passing shower.

01:53.029 --> 01:55.615
Stay here, guys.
I'll go get batteries and umbrellas.

01:55.698 --> 01:56.991
Don't go anywhere, please.

01:57.075 --> 01:58.743
We must have
our final interview here today.

01:58.827 --> 02:00.370
You want us to wait here alone?

02:00.453 --> 02:01.579
Yes, I won't take long.

02:01.663 --> 02:03.706
Wait, let me go with…

02:17.345 --> 02:18.680
How should I put it?

02:19.806 --> 02:23.393
Everything felt really awkward that day.

02:25.895 --> 02:27.147
It was just very awkward.

02:27.772 --> 02:30.608
It was sunny until just a while ago.

02:30.692 --> 02:32.402
I know.

02:42.662 --> 02:45.498
Suddenly, I was worried about her.

03:04.475 --> 03:05.602
Why?

03:12.233 --> 03:13.359
Thank you.

03:17.655 --> 03:20.116
Everything felt a little bit different.

03:20.200 --> 03:21.534
Aren't you cold?

03:22.118 --> 03:24.537
No. Not at all.

03:29.876 --> 03:32.253
Maybe it was
because it was our last shooting day.

03:50.104 --> 03:51.022
And it turned out…

03:51.940 --> 03:54.108
I wasn't the only one who felt that way.

03:56.361 --> 03:57.862
She also…

04:01.616 --> 04:03.034
Don't make me laugh.

04:04.494 --> 04:05.745
Is that what he said?

04:06.746 --> 04:09.582
Looks like he fabricated his memory again.

04:13.544 --> 04:15.713
It wasn't
that kind of mood that rainy day.

04:16.214 --> 04:17.340
What is it?

04:22.428 --> 04:24.973
It was like just an ordinary day.

04:26.349 --> 04:28.351
Would you stop distracting me
and just sit here?

04:34.983 --> 04:38.403
Oh, look.
It was sunny until just a while ago.

04:39.028 --> 04:40.405
Atmospheric instability.

04:41.030 --> 04:42.865
The upper layers contain cool air.

04:42.949 --> 04:45.118
The sudden increase in temperature
during the day

04:45.201 --> 04:47.036
has made the atmosphere unstable.

04:47.120 --> 04:49.080
The strong updraft
creates rain clouds that--

04:49.163 --> 04:51.582
Stop. Do you have to get
all scientific right now?

04:51.666 --> 04:52.709
You're tiring me out.

04:52.792 --> 04:56.504
We studied it in our freshman year,
but I guess you weren't paying attention.

04:57.672 --> 04:59.674
Choi Ung was still
dumb as usual.

05:11.144 --> 05:12.645
And he was still an idiot.

05:12.729 --> 05:13.604
What are you doing?

05:15.690 --> 05:18.818
Oh, you didn't see?

05:22.155 --> 05:24.282
- You can just keep it on.
- No, take it.

05:24.365 --> 05:26.200
Don't force yourself, okay? Keep it on.

05:26.284 --> 05:27.994
No, I said I'm fine.

05:28.077 --> 05:29.162
Gosh.

05:29.245 --> 05:30.913
Just take it, okay? Here.

05:40.715 --> 05:43.885
I guess, the details may have been
slightly different from hers…

05:45.219 --> 05:48.973
He probably remembers himself
as some really amazing guy back then.

05:49.057 --> 05:51.934
She must remember herself
as being all nonchalant,

05:52.018 --> 05:54.228
but she was the one
who was acting strange that day.

05:54.312 --> 05:57.231
Well, I was acting normally. As usual.

05:57.315 --> 05:59.317
It wasn't like her to do that.
But that day…

05:59.400 --> 06:00.777
That time, he was the one who kept--

06:00.860 --> 06:02.904
I can tell that she was
setting the mood that time.

06:11.120 --> 06:12.538
I need to move the cabbages.

06:13.581 --> 06:16.959
Wait, you're not going to mention
how she and I dated, are you?

06:17.043 --> 06:18.503
Not sure yet. That's up to me.

06:18.586 --> 06:20.338
Are you crazy? I won't allow it.

06:21.339 --> 06:23.049
I have the right, since I'm the producer.

06:24.592 --> 06:26.677
Nike, Coca Cola, McDonald's,

06:26.761 --> 06:28.679
Samsung, Volvo, Louis Vuitton, Chanel.

06:28.763 --> 06:31.974
Fucking, jerking, son of a bitch,

06:32.058 --> 06:34.227
shitty, bitchy, dickhead,

06:34.310 --> 06:36.354
motherfucker, jackass.

06:37.855 --> 06:39.649
You can choose not to cut that one,

06:39.732 --> 06:41.526
but you'll have to censor
every single word.

06:42.110 --> 06:43.528
You two are just like twins, you know.

06:43.611 --> 06:45.780
Don't you dare mention
our past relationship

06:45.863 --> 06:47.407
in any part of this. Okay?

06:47.907 --> 06:49.409
Are we done with the interview?

06:51.244 --> 06:54.205
EPISODE 4
THE BOY, OR THE GIRL, WE LIKED THEN

06:54.288 --> 06:56.374
- Did you have that recorded?
- Yeah. Why?

06:59.210 --> 07:03.047
So, okay.
These are your terms for doing this show?

07:03.131 --> 07:05.883
I'll be straightforward with you
since you know everything.

07:05.967 --> 07:08.010
We're not really doing this
because we want to.

07:08.094 --> 07:10.388
In fact, it'll be very uncomfortable.

07:11.514 --> 07:13.558
Uncomfortable? Maybe to you, but not me.

07:13.641 --> 07:15.643
Oh, boy.
I wonder why you feel that way.

07:15.726 --> 07:17.645
Really, you're okay with that?

07:17.728 --> 07:20.273
Oh, I'm so relieved to know
that you have no problems with that.

07:20.356 --> 07:22.567
Since you're pretty childish
and act like you're so pathetic,

07:22.650 --> 07:24.986
and I was really worried about you.

07:25.069 --> 07:25.987
Who's pathetic?

07:26.696 --> 07:28.531
That's not true.

07:28.614 --> 07:30.199
Okay, fine, that was a long time ago.

07:30.283 --> 07:32.952
And as you can see,
I've changed a bit. Hmm…

07:33.661 --> 07:37.290
See, I'm successful enough for someone
to visit and beg to work with me.

07:37.373 --> 07:40.293
Hey. When did I ever
beg you to work with me?

07:40.376 --> 07:43.629
Well, you crossed the line
when you called me pathetic.

07:43.713 --> 07:45.006
Zip it, you two.

07:45.715 --> 07:48.092
Can I read these terms in peace?

07:54.348 --> 07:55.808
DO NOT FILM MY PRIVATE LIFE
WITHOUT CONSENT

07:55.892 --> 07:58.019
VIOLATION OF THE TERMS
WILL LEAD TO TERMINATION OF THE SHOOT

08:00.521 --> 08:01.814
TERMS AND CONDITIONS

08:01.898 --> 08:03.983
DO NOT ANNOY ME
DO NOT BOTHER ME

08:06.110 --> 08:09.614
All right. I'll do my best
to comply to your terms.

08:11.032 --> 08:14.202
Oh, first of all, you need to get used
to having cameras around you.

08:14.285 --> 08:15.453
We won't do anything special.

08:15.536 --> 08:17.872
So you can both go on
with your daily lives.

08:17.955 --> 08:21.250
Then we'll proceed to filming
the both of you spending time together.

08:21.334 --> 08:24.545
My everyday routine is going to work
and coming home, and that's all.

08:24.629 --> 08:25.880
Would that be okay?

08:25.963 --> 08:28.090
I doubt my boss
will let you film me at work.

08:28.174 --> 08:30.510
He's already said yes,
so we'll be there to film you.

08:30.593 --> 08:32.887
He seemed happy,
since his project would gain attention.

08:33.471 --> 08:35.640
But I can't work
if there are others around me.

08:35.723 --> 08:37.975
Then we'll just
set up the camera without the crew.

08:38.059 --> 08:41.312
Look, do you honestly think
that this will be entertaining?

08:41.395 --> 08:43.356
I can already see that it'll be boring.

08:43.439 --> 08:46.275
Well, that's up to me to decide,
so don't worry.

08:46.359 --> 08:48.069
Do you have any other questions?

08:48.569 --> 08:51.572
But since apparently you both
feel uncomfortable about this,

08:51.656 --> 08:53.324
are you sure you'll be all right?

08:53.407 --> 08:55.243
- Jerk.
- Let's give it a shot, okay?

09:02.542 --> 09:05.127
Ji-ung. I'm afraid this will flop.

09:20.101 --> 09:22.395
Hey, I'm here already.

09:25.231 --> 09:26.232
What's this?

09:28.609 --> 09:29.860
Are you filming again?

09:31.862 --> 09:33.531
Are you filming him too?

09:33.614 --> 09:35.658
- Chang-sik, get out of the shot.
- Hello, Mr. Jung.

09:35.741 --> 09:40.204
By the way… Oh, hey there.
What's the concept for today?

09:40.288 --> 09:43.207
Don't worry about that, Mr. Jung.
You can just eat and leave after.

09:43.291 --> 09:45.293
Come on, how could I not worry about that?

09:45.376 --> 09:46.502
My goodness.

09:46.586 --> 09:49.130
Chang-sik, you're also here.
Go over there first.

09:49.213 --> 09:51.716
By the way, Ji-ung,
aren't you filming my hardware store?

09:51.799 --> 09:53.050
Why not?

09:56.846 --> 09:58.598
You're doing this again with Ung?

09:58.681 --> 09:59.932
Have you gone insane?

10:00.433 --> 10:03.019
Do you think I was really up for this?

10:03.102 --> 10:05.479
Too bad it's always the working class

10:05.563 --> 10:07.440
that has to make ends meet.

10:07.523 --> 10:09.567
But are you okay seeing that guy again?

10:09.650 --> 10:12.653
- Don't tell me that you two--
- I've had enough of your nonsense.

10:13.362 --> 10:14.864
Okay.

10:14.947 --> 10:16.866
What's over is over, you know that.

10:16.949 --> 10:19.452
- Just get a grip, okay?
- Goodness, it's nothing like that.

10:21.370 --> 10:22.997
Oh, how long have you been filming?

10:23.080 --> 10:25.583
Oh. Don't worry about us
and just talk freely.

10:25.666 --> 10:28.669
Um, you won't be able
to air this if we talk freely.

10:29.587 --> 10:32.673
Most office workers would rather
rest or sleep on the weekends,

10:32.757 --> 10:34.425
but I'm not like them, you know.

10:34.508 --> 10:37.303
I don't like wasting my time,
even on rest days.

10:37.386 --> 10:40.306
That's why I do productive activities,
even on weekends.

10:40.389 --> 10:41.682
Like this, you see.

10:41.766 --> 10:43.893
I like jogging in the morning.

10:45.269 --> 10:47.938
- I don't like naps.
- It's really obvious she's enjoying this.

10:48.022 --> 10:50.358
You should only sleep at night.
I hate being lazy in the day

10:50.441 --> 10:52.777
and waste time taking naps,
like someone does.

10:52.860 --> 10:55.237
So much for that, I'll slow down today.

10:55.321 --> 10:56.781
- Just follow me.
- Come on.

10:59.325 --> 11:01.869
It's also obvious
that she looked forward to this.

11:03.329 --> 11:05.164
What's this girl trying to do?

11:31.440 --> 11:32.316
STAR START-UP COMPANY

11:32.400 --> 11:33.859
Oh, yes.

12:03.639 --> 12:05.182
Our new menu. Try it.

12:12.857 --> 12:14.817
- Mmm.
- How is it? Is it good?

12:14.900 --> 12:17.987
- Not really.
- Go home. Why are you here?

12:18.070 --> 12:19.780
Also, get lost.

12:22.783 --> 12:26.704
Hey you, would you stop filming
and help me peel these onions instead.

12:26.787 --> 12:28.372
Come on, just pretend I'm invisible.

12:28.456 --> 12:30.958
Well, that sucks, producer Kim.

12:31.041 --> 12:34.462
Look, you need to film something fun,
yet here I am, peeling onions.

12:36.213 --> 12:38.424
Anyway, should I be more entertaining?

12:40.801 --> 12:41.635
I think he's lost it.

12:46.974 --> 12:48.976
Hey, what's up?

12:49.059 --> 12:50.936
Why are you so gloomy?

12:52.855 --> 12:54.857
Where are the new staff members?

12:55.566 --> 12:56.650
Oh.

12:58.194 --> 12:59.695
- Goodbye.
- Dong-il.

13:00.279 --> 13:01.822
I'm doing my best, okay.

13:01.906 --> 13:03.282
But they're already busy.

13:03.365 --> 13:05.910
The ones who are available
don't wanna work with you.

13:05.993 --> 13:07.536
That's not my fault.

13:07.620 --> 13:10.080
How could you not help us
during this critical moment?

13:10.164 --> 13:11.624
You're the one who forced me to do this.

13:11.707 --> 13:13.125
I get it, I do.

13:13.209 --> 13:16.629
I promise I will send you
some reliable crew members.

13:18.005 --> 13:19.381
So hang in there.

13:20.216 --> 13:22.510
Sorry, Chae-ran,
you have to go through this.

13:28.182 --> 13:31.143
- Any footage that we can save?
- No, none at all.

13:34.563 --> 13:35.940
I need you to call them over.

13:38.859 --> 13:39.944
Hmm?

13:41.070 --> 13:42.071
Ji-ung!

13:44.490 --> 13:45.533
Are you here?

13:48.702 --> 13:49.578
He left?

14:01.924 --> 14:05.261
At last. This filming
could end sooner than expected.

14:05.344 --> 14:06.387
And that's great.

14:11.100 --> 14:13.477
Finally, some peace for me.

14:42.256 --> 14:45.593
I have… trouble sleeping deeply.

14:49.805 --> 14:52.308
I'm always half-awake or half-asleep.

15:00.024 --> 15:04.194
I probably have… 500 dreams every time.

15:16.624 --> 15:19.043
That's why I often can't tell

15:20.127 --> 15:21.378
a dream from reality.

15:32.139 --> 15:35.517
- Hey, you okay?
- But this one is definitely a dream.

16:15.724 --> 16:17.059
- Oh!
- The hell?

16:18.060 --> 16:20.145
What? You're here.

16:20.771 --> 16:22.147
Yuck. What was that?

16:22.856 --> 16:24.400
You're… you're real.

16:24.483 --> 16:26.944
What are you talking about?
Were you dreaming?

16:27.027 --> 16:28.862
How long have you been here?

16:28.946 --> 16:31.740
It's just that you came over here
unannounced. So I was startled.

16:31.824 --> 16:33.409
I just got here, weirdo.

16:33.993 --> 16:35.244
Ji-ung wanted to talk to us now.

16:36.870 --> 16:39.456
You're sleeping in the middle of the day?

16:39.540 --> 16:40.749
Because I can't sleep well.

16:41.500 --> 16:42.459
Why can't you?

16:51.135 --> 16:52.094
Where's Ji-ung?

16:53.470 --> 16:54.972
He just went out for a bit.

16:55.556 --> 16:56.473
Oh.

17:19.038 --> 17:23.208
I'm… I'm going
to head down to my studio.

17:24.001 --> 17:24.877
Hmm?

17:26.420 --> 17:30.007
If you have nothing to do,
you can check out my drawings.

17:32.926 --> 17:35.345
Although, they're all downstairs.

17:48.233 --> 17:49.818
Wow.

17:58.202 --> 18:01.330
Oh, I really like that one.

18:02.164 --> 18:03.957
Don't study them
too closely, though.

18:04.583 --> 18:06.418
This one. Where's this located?

18:08.170 --> 18:09.671
Oh, this one here?

18:10.464 --> 18:12.674
This is in Paris, France.

18:12.758 --> 18:15.010
He's the one who designed the Soen Shop.

18:15.094 --> 18:16.804
And he's my favorite architect.

18:17.513 --> 18:19.890
I see. That's why you took the offer.

18:19.973 --> 18:21.058
Mm-hmm.

18:28.315 --> 18:29.983
This is truly unexpected of you.

18:31.110 --> 18:32.277
What do you mean?

18:32.361 --> 18:36.115
What I mean is, back then, when you were
drawing all the time in class,

18:36.198 --> 18:38.534
I thought you just didn't want to study.

18:38.617 --> 18:40.994
Hey, everyone has
their own strong suit, you know.

18:41.912 --> 18:44.957
Yet you were always nagging me
about studying day in, day out.

18:45.040 --> 18:47.000
Do you realize how sadistic you were?

18:47.084 --> 18:49.503
Thanks to my nagging,
you attended university.

18:57.719 --> 18:58.804
What?

19:02.099 --> 19:03.183
Isn't this…

19:17.072 --> 19:18.490
Oh.

19:19.867 --> 19:22.327
Oh, no. My bad.

19:24.621 --> 19:26.623
Hey, this is nothing serious.

19:26.707 --> 19:28.458
- You can just erase it, okay.
- No…

19:36.466 --> 19:38.468
- Turn off the camera.
- Please don't do it.

19:38.552 --> 19:39.970
Turn it off.

19:40.053 --> 19:42.723
No, I said
don't turn off your camera, please.

19:45.434 --> 19:47.102
Hey, Kook Yeon-su!

19:47.186 --> 19:48.645
Follow them, go on! Damn it.

21:21.738 --> 21:23.782
You said you threw it away.

21:23.865 --> 21:27.119
I thought I did. Why was this still there?

21:27.202 --> 21:29.621
You even caused a scene
and blamed me for ruining it.

21:29.705 --> 21:32.499
See? If you just glance at it,
you can't even tell.

21:32.582 --> 21:34.459
It's true that you ruined my drawing.

21:34.543 --> 21:35.752
Here. You can see it up close!

21:35.836 --> 21:37.629
Oh, please. It wasn't so bad.

21:37.713 --> 21:40.215
Yet you were so petty,
you sulked for days because of it.

21:40.299 --> 21:41.591
Am I wrong?

21:41.675 --> 21:43.510
There are many things about me
that you ruined.

21:44.386 --> 21:47.055
Hey, I only messed up one drawing…

21:47.139 --> 21:49.391
No, two. That's all.

21:49.474 --> 21:50.934
That's all I can remember.

21:51.768 --> 21:53.770
Well, you also ruined my life.

21:54.521 --> 21:56.231
You wreaked havoc.

21:56.857 --> 21:58.317
I shouldn't have said that.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.693
Hey.

22:01.611 --> 22:03.113
That was really harsh, Ung.

22:07.159 --> 22:08.785
What part of it did I ruin?

22:10.495 --> 22:12.247
Why the hell did I say that?

22:12.331 --> 22:15.792
What's this?
Are you not going to explain yourself now?

22:16.793 --> 22:17.669
It's the truth, though.

22:20.339 --> 22:23.216
I wonder, why do I get
so upset like this at times?

22:24.009 --> 22:26.094
Exactly how long
will you keep this up?

22:26.178 --> 22:29.306
How badly did I ruin your life
for you to act like that?

22:29.389 --> 22:31.099
Look around you. You're doing very well.

22:31.183 --> 22:32.476
So where's the havoc?

22:32.559 --> 22:35.145
Maybe it's hard to tell at a glance
like my drawing.

22:40.233 --> 22:43.070
How long will you treat me
like I'm a scum of the earth?

22:43.945 --> 22:47.908
We've agreed to do this documentary,
so can't we please just get along?

22:48.909 --> 22:50.243
That was also my intention.

22:51.161 --> 22:53.997
I'm sorry, I can't be like you.

22:55.123 --> 22:57.918
So why am I being
so pathetic at this moment?

23:07.469 --> 23:10.472
You think you're the victim here
because I kept quiet.

23:10.555 --> 23:11.723
You're ridiculous.

23:11.807 --> 23:13.642
Then speak your mind even for once.

23:15.102 --> 23:17.979
Do you think our breakup
was entirely my fault?

23:36.665 --> 23:38.083
Stop filming, Ji-ung.

23:39.459 --> 23:40.836
You caught me.

23:40.919 --> 23:43.130
Can we at least have some privacy?

23:44.172 --> 23:46.883
Well, it is my duty to film you.

23:46.967 --> 23:49.344
Why did you show up just now?
Let's go up and talk.

23:52.305 --> 23:53.390
Let's go.

24:05.068 --> 24:07.237
The atmosphere
feels tense right now.

24:10.282 --> 24:11.491
Or is it just me?

24:16.913 --> 24:19.666
I'm sorry,
but I have other plans for today.

24:19.749 --> 24:21.001
I should go. Just call me.

24:29.342 --> 24:30.677
Okay, so how about you…

24:31.678 --> 24:33.930
I'm having second thoughts
about this documentary.

24:40.979 --> 24:42.272
It's a total mess.

24:42.355 --> 24:44.274
We couldn't even talk about the concept.

24:44.357 --> 24:45.734
Well, we saw this one coming, though.

24:47.402 --> 24:50.572
So, okay. Should we just continue
following them around?

24:52.240 --> 24:53.241
Let's just call it a day.

24:53.325 --> 24:55.660
Are you going home? I can drop you off.

25:01.500 --> 25:03.752
I think we should start
with their reviews.

25:03.835 --> 25:05.003
What?

25:05.086 --> 25:06.671
On how they felt when they'd first met,

25:06.755 --> 25:09.382
on why they both agreed
to film it a decade ago,

25:10.300 --> 25:12.385
and how they feel after being reunited.

25:12.969 --> 25:15.305
Let's make them reminisce
about the good memories they had.

25:16.056 --> 25:16.890
Mm.

25:17.390 --> 25:19.184
They dated before, didn't they?

25:20.018 --> 25:20.852
You could tell?

25:20.936 --> 25:23.813
After watching the documentary
and seeing them in person,

25:23.897 --> 25:25.941
it was very obvious.

25:26.024 --> 25:28.401
You're quick to notice.
No wonder you're our ace.

25:30.403 --> 25:32.489
By the way,
when did you first meet Mr. Choi?

25:32.572 --> 25:34.199
Uh, at the entrance ceremony.

25:34.783 --> 25:36.326
He was standing behind me.

25:36.409 --> 25:37.911
He shouldn't have been there, though.

25:38.537 --> 25:40.330
Honestly, he seemed quite charming to me.

25:40.413 --> 25:42.582
Was he popular
with the students at your school?

25:42.666 --> 25:44.292
I take it back. You're not our ace.

25:44.376 --> 25:45.835
You're a terrible judge of character.

25:49.548 --> 25:50.674
Yeon-su was the popular one.

25:50.757 --> 25:52.050
You mean Ms. Kook?

25:52.842 --> 25:54.261
I could tell that she was,

25:54.344 --> 25:56.304
although she looked cold
in the documentary.

25:56.388 --> 25:58.890
That's the reason why the boys
couldn't approach her then.

25:59.808 --> 26:00.934
I think she doesn't know,

26:01.017 --> 26:02.894
that a lot of guys used to
have a crush on her.

26:06.648 --> 26:09.442
Did you two use to be close,
back in school?

26:09.526 --> 26:10.610
I'm not sure.

26:11.319 --> 26:13.863
I think I've always been just an observer.

26:15.907 --> 26:17.534
Oh, I think we're getting near now.

26:18.285 --> 26:19.786
You can just pull over there.

26:22.372 --> 26:24.499
You don't need
to come in early tomorrow.

26:25.333 --> 26:26.585
You know something?

26:26.668 --> 26:29.629
Our colleagues think that
you're a very cold and unfriendly person.

26:29.713 --> 26:31.798
I know I'm not popular with them.

26:31.881 --> 26:34.342
That's the reason why
nobody wants to work with me.

26:34.426 --> 26:35.969
You are popular, though.

26:36.052 --> 26:38.138
It's just that you always
seem unapproachable.

26:38.763 --> 26:39.931
You probably don't know this,

26:40.015 --> 26:42.475
but I honestly think that
many women have a crush on you.

26:43.810 --> 26:45.145
Shut up.

26:46.146 --> 26:47.897
Well, thank you. That's comforting.

26:48.565 --> 26:51.192
I wish more people knew
this side of you, the good one.

26:51.818 --> 26:53.403
Thank you for dropping me off.

26:53.486 --> 26:55.196
Sure. Get home safely.

26:57.949 --> 27:00.201
What the? Who is he?

27:00.285 --> 27:04.164
Oh, you didn't see him?
He was in the car with us all along.

27:04.247 --> 27:07.083
- Who is he?
- He's our reliable help sent by Mr. Park.

27:07.167 --> 27:09.085
He's an intern.

27:09.169 --> 27:11.379
It's nice to meet you.
I'm Im Tae-hun, sir.

27:11.963 --> 27:12.922
Intern?

27:13.006 --> 27:16.426
He started working yesterday
and hasn't gone home since then.

27:16.509 --> 27:17.761
Yeah, but I'm okay with that.

27:17.844 --> 27:19.638
But why would he send him to us?

27:19.721 --> 27:21.431
This isn't a daycare center.

27:21.514 --> 27:23.308
We're talking about
Mr. Park here, you know.

27:23.391 --> 27:25.393
Oh, damn it!

27:26.227 --> 27:28.396
Everything about this docu
is getting out of hand.

27:28.480 --> 27:29.731
Can't you just send him back?

27:29.814 --> 27:31.358
I'd rather work alone now.

27:34.778 --> 27:35.654
- Get out.
- What?

27:35.737 --> 27:37.197
- Sure.
- Oh, okay.

27:51.795 --> 27:54.255
Well, you also ruined my life.
You wreaked havoc.

27:55.006 --> 27:57.717
Why did I have to say that
and sound so pathetic?

27:58.677 --> 28:00.303
Damn it.

28:10.855 --> 28:12.691
I guess I won't sleep tonight.

28:18.780 --> 28:21.491
Do you think our breakup
was entirely my fault?

28:22.575 --> 28:25.662
I really shouldn't have said that to him.

28:26.996 --> 28:30.792
Kook Yeon-su, are you insane?
You should have kept your cool.

28:55.650 --> 28:58.945
Do I really have to do this
for an entire month?

29:11.875 --> 29:13.960
HE'S LYING DOWN, HE'S SLEEPING

29:17.756 --> 29:19.466
Just what do I do with those two?

29:24.012 --> 29:24.929
SOEN

29:25.013 --> 29:28.808
In any case, I'm very delighted
that we could do this project together.

29:28.892 --> 29:29.726
It's our pleasure.

29:29.809 --> 29:32.520
We're truly honored
to work on this project with your group.

29:32.604 --> 29:34.314
It wasn't easy, to be honest,

29:34.397 --> 29:37.650
but Ms. Kook here,
has truly put her heart into it this one.

29:37.734 --> 29:39.861
Oh, I'm really flattered.

29:40.862 --> 29:43.698
I hope that this documentary
can also be of some advantage to us

29:43.782 --> 29:45.158
and can be used to promote our project.

29:45.742 --> 29:49.829
And I'd like to meet with the artist
in person, to get to know him better.

29:49.913 --> 29:52.040
Oh, excuse me,
can we all meet here instead--

29:52.123 --> 29:53.708
Oh, no need. I'll just go to you to do it.

29:53.792 --> 29:57.003
It must have been a hassle
to come all the way here all the time.

29:57.086 --> 29:59.506
So, it's better if I come to you.

30:00.256 --> 30:02.592
All right. We'll be very grateful
if you could do that for us.

30:02.675 --> 30:03.968
Okay. Shall we end this meeting?

30:04.052 --> 30:06.179
Oh, you can go ahead.

30:07.388 --> 30:10.600
By the way, we'll be holding
a small opening party this coming Friday.

30:10.683 --> 30:13.728
- And you can attend if you're free--
- Oh, a party? That'd be awesome.

30:13.812 --> 30:15.855
Yeah, party people. Yeah.

30:18.233 --> 30:20.860
Will you be able
to attend this Friday's party?

30:20.944 --> 30:22.779
- Well, I have--
- Come on, you should go!

30:23.738 --> 30:27.617
Sure. I guess I'll be there,
if I have nothing scheduled.

30:27.700 --> 30:30.620
Well then, I'd like to speak
with Ms. Kook in private, so excuse us.

30:30.703 --> 30:32.080
Sure.

30:35.834 --> 30:38.670
- What'd you think?
- Looking at them now, I'm convinced.

30:38.753 --> 30:41.422
- What's this about?
- I'm 900-percent sure of it.

30:41.506 --> 30:42.590
Come with me.

30:42.674 --> 30:44.425
- Come on, hurry.
- But what about Ms. Kook?

30:45.093 --> 30:46.177
I have no idea, honestly.

30:47.929 --> 30:49.514
- People love your work…
- What?

30:49.597 --> 30:51.766
- …especially your…
- He's even appearing on TV?

30:52.350 --> 30:54.602
With that being said,
what do you think won their hearts?

30:54.686 --> 30:57.230
- I'm not really sure.
- Did you pull an all-nighter?

30:57.313 --> 30:59.023
Wow, you're still filming him.

30:59.107 --> 31:00.400
Morning!

31:00.483 --> 31:03.069
Why'd you have to ruin my morning
by watching that crap?

31:03.152 --> 31:05.905
Oh, right. Nu-a is even
doing TV interviews lately.

31:06.531 --> 31:08.199
I really don't care.

31:09.117 --> 31:11.703
It's about time that
you revealed yourself to people

31:11.786 --> 31:14.205
and get rid of all the fake artists
out there, you know?

31:14.289 --> 31:15.874
So, should I schedule an interview?

31:15.957 --> 31:17.542
No, thanks.

31:17.625 --> 31:18.918
What's my schedule for this week?

31:19.752 --> 31:22.255
You have a meeting tomorrow
for that live drawing show.

31:22.338 --> 31:24.048
What?

31:25.049 --> 31:26.134
And then what else?

31:26.217 --> 31:28.678
- What's that asshole saying?
- … even saying plagiarism.

31:28.761 --> 31:31.055
Can you share with us,
what is your take on this?

31:31.681 --> 31:33.558
Ung. Get over here.

31:33.641 --> 31:35.310
This is a serious matter. Hurry up!

31:35.393 --> 31:37.228
- What is it this time?
- I'm not sure.

31:37.312 --> 31:38.771
Honestly, it's hard to say.

31:38.855 --> 31:41.399
This asshole's clearly
making fun of you right now.

31:42.233 --> 31:44.903
As you know, guys,
plagiarism isn't always black and white.

31:44.986 --> 31:46.779
- It's a vague thing. Right.
- Right.

31:46.863 --> 31:49.782
I'm sure that the artist knows the best.

31:49.866 --> 31:54.203
Or maybe I inspired him with
his work, since they're similar to mine.

31:54.287 --> 31:55.997
- I don't mind that.
- I see.

31:57.665 --> 32:00.585
Has he gone insane?
He thinks you plagiarized his work.

32:00.668 --> 32:03.922
This won't do. Ung, don't worry, okay.
I'll contact all the reporters I know.

32:04.005 --> 32:05.590
Oh, forget it. Just ignore him.

32:06.174 --> 32:08.551
How can I ignore him
after what he just said on that TV show.

32:08.635 --> 32:10.845
Don't even think of responding.
It's tiring.

32:10.929 --> 32:13.348
Oh, no, you don't have to do anything.
I got it--

32:15.141 --> 32:18.144
I said, do nothing
if you wanna keep your job.

32:30.323 --> 32:32.784
Ms. Kook, I think you should see this one.

32:40.124 --> 32:41.542
IS GO-OH GUILTY OF PLAGIARISM?

32:41.626 --> 32:44.879
What do we do?
Should we inform Soen about this matter?

32:47.715 --> 32:50.218
I'll take care of Soen,
so don't do anything for now.

32:50.301 --> 32:52.845
And one more thing,
don't contact the artist.

32:52.929 --> 32:56.015
Would that be okay?
The public is quite upset about it.

32:56.099 --> 32:57.100
It's okay, really.

33:00.144 --> 33:03.022
Is there something you already know?
How are you so confident?

33:03.106 --> 33:06.317
It's not plagiarism.
So don't worry about it and keep working.

33:31.259 --> 33:34.137
Hey, what did he say? How is he?

33:34.220 --> 33:35.596
Well, he kicked me out, you know.

33:36.180 --> 33:38.141
He's so upset right now.

33:39.100 --> 33:41.394
He remained silent about it,
so I just gave up.

33:41.894 --> 33:44.856
Uh, damn it.
We really should counter that allegation.

33:44.939 --> 33:47.358
Leave him be.
He doesn't wanna get involved.

33:47.942 --> 33:49.402
This is what I think.

33:49.485 --> 33:52.030
He and Nu-a must have
known each other one way or another.

33:52.113 --> 33:54.615
But it's so frustrating
since he won't tell me anything.

33:55.366 --> 33:56.534
Wait, do you know anything?

33:58.995 --> 34:01.414
I don't. But he seems familiar.

34:11.340 --> 34:14.260
BEER IS LIFE
DAILYBEER

34:15.595 --> 34:18.181
We don't know anything
since he doesn't talk much.

34:18.264 --> 34:19.140
And there are times,

34:20.016 --> 34:22.226
when I just don't know
what's running through his mind.

34:22.310 --> 34:23.895
I really have no idea.

34:23.978 --> 34:27.190
His mom and I were very busy
ever since he was a little boy.

34:27.273 --> 34:30.526
Like he'd just sit on our bench
and play all by himself every day.

34:31.110 --> 34:32.403
He was always alone.

34:32.487 --> 34:34.280
I think maybe he got used to it.

34:35.406 --> 34:37.909
But then he was different
when he used to be with Yeon-su.

34:37.992 --> 34:39.619
He seemed energetic and full of life.

34:39.702 --> 34:41.079
And he also looked happy, you know.

34:41.162 --> 34:43.164
When I heard that you were filming
the documentary,

34:43.247 --> 34:44.874
and I would be seeing those cameras again,

34:44.957 --> 34:47.752
I literally jumped for joy, yes.

34:47.835 --> 34:51.339
If only he could be
just as lively as he was then,

34:51.422 --> 34:52.757
that would make me so happy.

35:05.728 --> 35:06.729
Yeah?

35:10.274 --> 35:11.109
Ung.

35:12.235 --> 35:14.403
The meeting with Soen is tomorrow.

35:14.987 --> 35:16.948
I can push it back if you want.

35:17.657 --> 35:18.699
What do you mean?

35:19.367 --> 35:21.536
What if they bring up
that stupid plagiarism issue?

35:21.619 --> 35:23.162
It's okay, I don't mind.

35:24.205 --> 35:25.957
Oh, did we receive any call?

35:26.040 --> 35:27.625
You mean from Soen?

35:27.708 --> 35:28.709
What I mean is…

35:29.460 --> 35:31.629
- Um, did anyone call us?
- No one did.

35:33.506 --> 35:35.883
I see. You can go.

35:36.926 --> 35:38.386
Okay, then.

35:39.095 --> 35:40.388
I'm going to sleep at home.

35:40.972 --> 35:42.890
I hope you'll be able to sleep well.

35:42.974 --> 35:44.559
- I'll get going.
- Mm-hmm.

35:57.822 --> 35:58.781
What now?

35:59.532 --> 36:01.367
Isn't she interested in me anymore?

36:15.923 --> 36:19.260
RISING STAR GO-OH
ACCUSED OF PLAGIARISM

36:31.189 --> 36:35.193
NU-A DRAWS USING A DRAWING TABLET
WHILE GO-OH DRAWS BY HAND

37:01.010 --> 37:04.138
Hey, how could you make your artist
wait for you, Eun-ho?

37:04.222 --> 37:06.390
I'm really sorry, Ung.
I'm almost there.

37:06.474 --> 37:09.352
Just go inside, say hello to everyone,
sit down and stay calm. Okay?

37:09.435 --> 37:10.353
You got me?

37:10.436 --> 37:11.312
Bye.

37:14.398 --> 37:15.483
Well…

37:16.025 --> 37:17.109
I'm afraid

37:18.194 --> 37:19.779
I'll have to find a new manager.

37:24.533 --> 37:26.494
See, I'm never wrong with these things.

37:26.577 --> 37:28.621
- Hey, Myeong-ho.
- Yeah?

37:28.704 --> 37:31.499
Did you see Mr. Jang a while ago?

37:31.582 --> 37:34.377
He was looking for Ms. Kook
as soon as he arrived.

37:34.460 --> 37:35.670
He even had coffee.

37:35.753 --> 37:38.547
Yes, I saw him.
Now I'm also sure about it.

37:38.631 --> 37:39.757
Sure about what?

37:40.925 --> 37:43.803
I'm pretty sure that Mr. Jang
has a crush on Ms. Kook.

37:43.886 --> 37:45.513
Right. You weren't
at the previous meeting.

37:45.596 --> 37:47.014
It was so obvious that day.

37:48.724 --> 37:50.893
That cold-hearted man
was so soft towards her,

37:50.977 --> 37:52.478
it's as if he was a different person.

37:52.561 --> 37:54.480
That's exactly what I've been telling you.

37:55.273 --> 37:58.609
Oh, the meeting's about to start.
Is everything all set?

37:58.693 --> 38:00.236
I already took care of it.

38:00.736 --> 38:01.862
- Goodness.
- Thanks a lot.

38:01.946 --> 38:04.323
Has Go-oh arrived already?
Because I really can't wait.

38:04.407 --> 38:05.574
Me too.

38:05.658 --> 38:08.869
- Stop being curious and join the meeting.
- Sure.

38:08.953 --> 38:11.580
- Okay then. I'll just be waiting inside.
- Okay.

38:11.664 --> 38:12.748
- Let's go.
- See you.

38:12.832 --> 38:14.333
Oh, goodness gracious!

38:15.501 --> 38:16.836
Did I spill my coffee?

38:17.586 --> 38:19.422
Oh, that would have been a disaster.

38:19.505 --> 38:20.715
Oh, my. How can I help…

38:22.633 --> 38:24.302
What? Oh!

38:25.011 --> 38:26.220
You're Choi Ung!

38:44.363 --> 38:46.615
Oh, uh, the meeting's this way.

38:46.699 --> 38:47.700
Please.

38:55.082 --> 38:57.209
- I like the beginning part.
- Okay.

38:57.293 --> 39:00.046
- We should begin from here, this part.
- Okay.

39:02.340 --> 39:03.466
Excuse me.

39:04.383 --> 39:06.844
I'm pretty sure that Mr. Jang
has a crush on Ms. Kook.

39:14.560 --> 39:17.438
What do you think?
Should we begin once your manager arrives?

39:17.521 --> 39:20.441
Oh, well, we can start
this meeting now, it's okay.

39:20.524 --> 39:22.401
I think it'd be best if he were here.

39:23.152 --> 39:26.572
Then would you mind if I ask you
a question before we begin?

39:27.490 --> 39:28.574
Sure.

39:29.617 --> 39:31.786
I'd like to ask about
the issue concerning you right now.

39:33.871 --> 39:34.705
Is it plagiarism?

39:35.456 --> 39:38.209
- But, Mr. Jang--
- I tend to be straightforward, you know.

39:38.709 --> 39:42.129
I'm sorry if I offended you,
but this matter is very important to us.

39:49.720 --> 39:51.055
Must I answer that?

39:51.138 --> 39:52.973
That'd be best for our sake.

40:04.527 --> 40:07.780
There's nothing to worry about.
That wasn't plagiarism.

40:08.823 --> 40:11.826
Well, from what I know,
plagiarism isn't always black and white.

40:11.909 --> 40:14.286
And I heard it's hard to prove
that you didn't plagiarize anything.

40:14.787 --> 40:16.372
So how will you go about
that allegation concerning you?

40:16.455 --> 40:18.749
Are you really sure
that this won't be an issue?

40:18.833 --> 40:21.085
Excuse me, but I don't think
that's something you should--

40:21.168 --> 40:22.378
It's pretty simple, really.

40:23.045 --> 40:25.256
There are many reasons
to back my argument,

40:25.339 --> 40:28.175
but they won't find proof
that I plagiarized anything.

40:28.259 --> 40:29.718
That's why I'm confident.

40:34.598 --> 40:35.891
Thank you for telling us that.

40:35.975 --> 40:38.352
I had no choice
but to confirm this with you.

40:38.436 --> 40:41.105
I knew it could sound offensive,
but I had to ask you anyway.

40:41.188 --> 40:44.483
But since you're sure of it,
we can proceed with this project.

40:44.567 --> 40:45.901
Sure. That's all right.

40:45.985 --> 40:47.945
And by the way,
if you're free this Friday,

40:48.028 --> 40:50.948
would you like to come and attend
Soen's opening party?

40:51.031 --> 40:52.992
We would be happy if you could make it.

40:53.075 --> 40:55.453
I'd also like to make up
for what I did today.

40:55.536 --> 40:56.954
Can you let me think about it?

40:57.037 --> 40:58.914
Ms. Kook will also be attending the event.

41:01.625 --> 41:02.918
Am I right, Ms. Kook?

41:04.587 --> 41:06.464
Uh. Well, I'm…

41:11.302 --> 41:12.678
Okay, I'm going.

41:15.931 --> 41:17.141
Thank you for inviting me.

41:19.602 --> 41:21.812
Hello. everyone.
I'm so sorry for being late.

41:21.896 --> 41:23.355
- Have a seat, please.
- Okay.

41:25.483 --> 41:28.652
All right, then.
Let's skip the beginning part.

41:28.736 --> 41:31.071
You better not be late
for another meeting.

41:31.155 --> 41:33.699
I'm really, really sorry.
Oh, should we call a cab?

41:34.325 --> 41:35.326
Hold on.

41:38.370 --> 41:40.456
Have you ever been to a party?

41:41.207 --> 41:44.126
A party? What kind? A birthday party?

41:44.752 --> 41:46.921
Not that. It's more of a classy one.

41:47.004 --> 41:48.631
Oh, a classy one.

41:49.423 --> 41:50.799
- So have you?
- I haven't.

41:50.883 --> 41:53.427
I only see them on TV.
I've never been to one. Why?

41:54.762 --> 41:56.805
I'm just wondering
what the dress code might be.

41:58.349 --> 42:00.226
A tuxedo and then a bow tie?

42:03.354 --> 42:05.523
Forget it. I shouldn't have asked you.

42:05.606 --> 42:06.899
Hey, what's this about?

42:07.775 --> 42:10.945
Never mind. Go home first.
I need to stop by somewhere.

42:11.028 --> 42:13.030
Hey, Ji-ung,
let's just end the shoot here.

42:13.113 --> 42:14.365
This is personal.

42:14.448 --> 42:15.699
But it's my job to film your private life.

42:15.783 --> 42:17.493
I'm sure you got enough today.

42:17.576 --> 42:21.455
And if you never give me any privacy,
I'm just going to drop out of this.

42:21.539 --> 42:23.541
Okay. I'll let it slide for today.

42:23.624 --> 42:26.961
But let me tell you,
that threat is getting old real fast.

42:30.172 --> 42:31.131
Where is he going?

42:32.508 --> 42:34.134
Oh, I think you'd look great in that.

42:54.947 --> 42:56.865
KOOK YEON-SU

43:13.132 --> 43:14.133
Oh.

43:16.969 --> 43:18.596
- This way, please.
- Come this way.

43:31.609 --> 43:32.901
Hello there, Mr. Choi.

43:33.736 --> 43:35.446
Wow. Hi.

43:36.113 --> 43:38.240
I never thought
I'd visit a place like this.

43:39.199 --> 43:42.453
Well, I'm obviously
underdressed for this place, right?

43:43.287 --> 43:45.998
Don't worry, though.
I'll take care of you.

43:46.081 --> 43:49.043
I never expected you
to wanna shop with me, to be honest.

43:49.126 --> 43:50.461
You're always unpredictable.

43:50.544 --> 43:53.172
I'm so sorry.
You must have been very flustered.

43:53.255 --> 43:55.424
I was only flustered
that I couldn't say no

43:55.507 --> 43:56.967
since I had an empty schedule anyway.

43:57.051 --> 43:58.302
That's a relief.

43:58.385 --> 44:00.554
Anyway, thank you so much for your help.

44:00.638 --> 44:03.641
I promise to repay you
with much kindness later on.

44:03.724 --> 44:06.518
Honestly, I've never
bought a suit in my life,

44:06.602 --> 44:07.978
so I didn't know what to buy.

44:08.812 --> 44:10.689
And you were the only one
I could think of.

44:10.773 --> 44:13.859
Oh. I like so much what you just said.

44:16.028 --> 44:18.989
I hope it'll stay that way,
even in the future, Mr. Choi.

44:20.949 --> 44:23.661
All right.
Shall we have some fun today then?

44:24.161 --> 44:25.329
Uh…

44:35.297 --> 44:36.298
That one.

44:42.680 --> 44:43.514
NJ.

44:59.363 --> 45:00.698
It's comfortable.

45:02.908 --> 45:04.201
How are these?

45:04.284 --> 45:05.536
What about these?

45:24.972 --> 45:26.056
I like it.

45:30.728 --> 45:33.355
Oh, NJ, you left your shopping bags there.

45:33.939 --> 45:36.567
Oh, it's okay.
They'll send them over to my place.

45:36.650 --> 45:39.486
Wow, we really live
in two different worlds.

45:40.654 --> 45:43.240
We went shopping for four hours today.

45:43.323 --> 45:45.075
That's pretty short, right?

45:45.159 --> 45:47.911
- And I only shopped for 30 minutes though.
- Aren't you hungry now?

45:47.995 --> 45:50.706
Oh, let me treat you,
as a way of thanking you.

45:50.789 --> 45:52.791
Sure, I'm craving for something.

45:59.506 --> 46:02.968
You know, I may not be
as wealthy as you are.

46:03.051 --> 46:04.386
But I'm still well off.

46:04.928 --> 46:07.222
And I could have bought you
fancier food, at least.

46:08.766 --> 46:11.477
Shopping and tteokbokki
go hand in hand, that's why.

46:11.560 --> 46:14.938
I'd feel guilty about spending money
every time I shopped in the past.

46:15.022 --> 46:17.524
So I'd starve myself
or have tteokbokki or fish cakes.

46:17.608 --> 46:19.109
It's a guilty pleasure.

46:19.193 --> 46:21.737
Oh. I'm actually surprised
you're like that.

46:22.571 --> 46:24.865
Well, I may seem like a born-to-be star,

46:24.948 --> 46:27.201
but I was a normal kid like the others.

46:35.542 --> 46:36.835
So why did you want to shop?

46:36.919 --> 46:38.670
Are you appearing on TV?

46:39.254 --> 46:41.673
Are you taking revenge on that guy Nu-a?

46:41.757 --> 46:43.383
Did you watch that one?

46:43.467 --> 46:45.761
There were news articles on it,
so of course I did.

46:45.844 --> 46:46.804
I always read the news.

46:47.888 --> 46:48.722
Mm…

46:49.306 --> 46:50.557
That's not the reason why.

46:51.391 --> 46:52.976
I'm attending an opening party.

46:53.060 --> 46:54.812
Hmm, a party?

46:55.979 --> 46:58.398
Well then, wear the first shirt
that has no tie.

46:58.482 --> 47:00.359
Match that with the second pair of shoes.

47:00.442 --> 47:03.904
Oh, wow, you're really
a pro at these things.

47:05.531 --> 47:06.782
That's the price of fame, you know?

47:08.116 --> 47:09.159
What?

47:09.660 --> 47:12.120
Fame isn't always
about the prestige of getting known.

47:12.704 --> 47:14.414
What I mean is,
now that you're famous,

47:14.498 --> 47:16.792
people are making
ridiculous rumors about you.

47:21.296 --> 47:22.172
Thank you then.

47:23.966 --> 47:26.718
That means you believe
that I didn't plagiarize.

47:26.802 --> 47:29.972
I'm on your side, of course.
I have an eye for art.

47:34.017 --> 47:35.310
Please enjoy.

47:35.394 --> 47:36.436
Thank you so much.

47:36.520 --> 47:39.022
- Hang on, can we have two soju glasses?
- Okay.

47:39.106 --> 47:40.315
Are we drinking now?

47:40.399 --> 47:43.944
'Cause I think ending this night
with soju would be perfect.

47:44.027 --> 47:45.529
But I have a shoot tomorrow.

47:45.612 --> 47:48.490
Although I'd crave it too much
if you drank some only by yourself,

47:48.991 --> 47:51.743
so let's just pretend this water is soju.

48:03.213 --> 48:05.924
I know…
you didn't plagiarize anything,

48:06.008 --> 48:07.134
so don't worry about it.

48:17.227 --> 48:20.814
Don't take to heart
what Mr. Jang said today.

48:33.118 --> 48:35.954
I BELIEVE YOU

48:56.934 --> 48:59.102
Hey, have you seen my car keys?

48:59.186 --> 49:00.437
Wait, what did you say?

49:01.355 --> 49:03.982
- Have you seen my car keys?
- Car keys?

49:04.066 --> 49:05.651
Why would you look for them?

49:05.734 --> 49:07.819
You put them away somewhere
since you never drive.

49:13.200 --> 49:14.284
You really don't know?

49:14.368 --> 49:15.577
Who are you?

49:15.661 --> 49:17.412
I know I look awkward.

49:17.496 --> 49:18.872
Are you going on a blind date tonight?

49:18.956 --> 49:20.207
Shut up.

49:21.208 --> 49:23.627
That hurt my pride,
but my heart fluttered a bit.

49:23.710 --> 49:24.878
Hey, you come back here.

49:24.962 --> 49:28.006
- I said, shut up, okay?
- Tell me where you're going first.

49:28.090 --> 49:29.549
Why aren't you taking me with you?

50:14.553 --> 50:16.847
I shouldn't have come.

50:16.930 --> 50:18.348
This was a bad idea.

50:22.269 --> 50:23.603
I'm sorry.

50:40.412 --> 50:41.705
Where are you going?

50:43.707 --> 50:45.500
Why are you leaving me here alone?

50:45.584 --> 50:48.295
Uh, I was just…

50:48.378 --> 50:49.921
Hi, Ms. Kook.

50:51.006 --> 50:51.923
You're here now.

50:52.799 --> 50:54.217
Oh, I see you're here too.

50:54.301 --> 50:55.594
Thanks for coming.

50:55.677 --> 50:57.054
I just had to keep my word.

50:57.137 --> 50:59.097
Then I hope you both enjoy the party.

50:59.181 --> 51:00.557
There's someone
I'd like you to meet right now.

51:00.640 --> 51:02.100
- Okay.
- This way.

51:06.938 --> 51:08.440
They're from France.

51:09.566 --> 51:11.568
Gentlemen,
I'd like you to meet Ms. Kook.

51:20.452 --> 51:23.622
I don't have a single idea
why I came to this party.

51:25.457 --> 51:26.458
Hey.

51:27.042 --> 51:29.252
You've gone too far
by coming all the way here, you know.

51:29.336 --> 51:32.255
Didn't you wanna show that you're not
the same loser you were 10 years ago?

51:32.339 --> 51:33.173
Today is your chance.

51:34.091 --> 51:35.759
Well, it's not bad, right?

51:35.842 --> 51:36.843
Whatever.

51:38.261 --> 51:40.263
- Let's film Yeon-su now.
- Okay.

51:40.347 --> 51:42.390
Hey, hold on. Don't bother.

51:42.474 --> 51:45.560
She's surrounded by people right now
and pretending to be pre-occupied.

51:46.269 --> 51:48.021
Be right back.

51:57.739 --> 51:58.573
Hey.

51:59.241 --> 52:00.784
It's been a long time.

52:01.660 --> 52:04.287
I wasn't sure, but you came.
How long has it been?

52:07.749 --> 52:09.334
Where are you going? I'm talking to you.

52:10.418 --> 52:11.711
Drop it.

52:12.462 --> 52:14.297
You're not someone worth my time.

52:15.090 --> 52:17.092
What the…? Why are you so edgy?

52:17.175 --> 52:19.094
I'm just not interested in talking.

52:19.177 --> 52:20.011
Step aside.

52:20.095 --> 52:22.556
Are you still bitter toward me?
You have to be honest.

52:22.639 --> 52:24.057
Not sure.

52:25.058 --> 52:26.518
I pitied you a bit back then.

52:27.435 --> 52:28.728
But now I'm just indifferent.

52:33.692 --> 52:35.777
Why haven't you countered the allegation?

52:35.861 --> 52:37.112
You can't be bothered by it?

52:38.280 --> 52:39.406
You're smart after all.

52:39.906 --> 52:42.450
Then you must know
that I'm wasting my time right now.

52:46.163 --> 52:47.747
Let's just do well, okay?

52:50.292 --> 52:51.209
What's that?

52:52.919 --> 52:54.004
Sorry?

52:54.713 --> 52:57.090
Haven't you heard? Did you think…

52:58.300 --> 53:00.302
that you were the only one doing it?

53:02.137 --> 53:03.054
What?

53:05.515 --> 53:07.058
I'm also doing the live show.

53:08.059 --> 53:09.060
But now I guess…

53:10.353 --> 53:12.189
you weren't that reliable.

53:24.993 --> 53:27.787
What the hell is going on here?

53:27.871 --> 53:30.457
- It's for the best, right?
- Of course, it is.

53:30.540 --> 53:33.710
Two controversial artists
will be competing against each other.

53:33.793 --> 53:36.129
I bet this will definitely
be a spectacle.

53:36.213 --> 53:37.172
You think so?

53:37.672 --> 53:39.799
Of course.

53:41.801 --> 53:45.138
I mean, he grabbed the opportunity
when it came. I'm excited for this.

53:45.222 --> 53:47.766
- Yeah, me too.
- Of course, who wouldn't be right?

53:52.103 --> 53:53.521
- Kook Yeon-su.
- Huh?

53:55.690 --> 53:56.733
Hmm?

53:57.943 --> 53:59.194
Do you know about this?

54:00.904 --> 54:01.905
About what?

54:03.490 --> 54:04.491
What is it?

54:05.867 --> 54:09.412
Why is he giving me that look right now?
What is it this time?

54:09.496 --> 54:10.497
Did you…

54:12.082 --> 54:13.750
also know about it?

54:15.001 --> 54:16.878
Excuse me, what's this about?

54:18.004 --> 54:19.256
Did you know that…

54:20.507 --> 54:22.717
that Nu-a's also
taking part in this project?

54:24.219 --> 54:25.262
I'm asking you, Ms. Kook.

54:28.848 --> 54:30.892
Wait, what do you…

54:34.729 --> 54:35.897
Excuse me.

54:36.564 --> 54:38.858
Can we just talk about that matter later?

54:40.694 --> 54:41.820
You see?

54:43.029 --> 54:44.447
It's always been you…

54:46.616 --> 54:47.867
You ruin me.

55:15.353 --> 55:18.481
Well, I was acting normally.
As usual.

55:18.565 --> 55:21.026
It wasn't like her to do that.
But that day…

55:21.109 --> 55:22.861
That time
he was the one who kept--

55:22.944 --> 55:25.113
I can tell that
she was setting the mood that time.

55:25.613 --> 55:27.073
I can tell she's very…

55:27.157 --> 55:28.366
Hey.

55:29.909 --> 55:32.620
What… what will you say
in our final interview?

55:32.704 --> 55:34.122
Hmm?

55:34.205 --> 55:37.083
I mean, during the previous interview,

55:37.167 --> 55:40.295
you said you were wasting your time
because you had to film with me.

55:40.378 --> 55:43.048
Did you overhear that?
You shouldn't eavesdrop.

55:46.634 --> 55:47.969
But how about this time?

55:49.054 --> 55:51.139
Do you think you're still wasting time?

55:52.390 --> 55:55.185
He looked very serious,
which was so unlike him.

55:55.268 --> 55:57.604
Hmm? How about now?

55:58.271 --> 56:00.023
He also asked
a strange question.

56:03.276 --> 56:04.152
Well…

56:05.236 --> 56:09.366
I guess I don't completely
feel that way anymore.

56:12.369 --> 56:14.287
And since today is our final shooting,

56:15.038 --> 56:16.706
I'll tell them that I'm okay with it now.

56:19.876 --> 56:22.462
To my surprise,
she even smiled at me.

56:25.048 --> 56:26.883
And you? How was it for you?

56:30.428 --> 56:32.847
What? What are you gonna say?

56:34.391 --> 56:37.352
"She's annoying,
bothersome, and irritating."

56:37.435 --> 56:39.020
"I wish she never came to school."

56:39.104 --> 56:40.730
"I'd hit her with a camera if I could--"

56:40.814 --> 56:42.899
That's enough. I get it, so stop it.

56:44.317 --> 56:46.486
Why did I even ask you?

56:46.569 --> 56:48.780
- And…
- Yeah, I get it that you don't like me.

56:48.863 --> 56:49.697
Shut up, I--

56:49.781 --> 56:53.326
That's… not true, you know?

56:54.994 --> 56:58.248
That's the reason why
I blurted out something so stupid.

56:59.833 --> 57:00.875
I don't dislike you.

57:08.925 --> 57:11.803
Thank you for not disliking me.

57:16.599 --> 57:18.476
He kept staring at me
at that moment.

57:19.060 --> 57:20.270
It was really strange.

57:25.400 --> 57:26.526
Uh, and you?

57:37.620 --> 57:38.538
Hey.

57:39.122 --> 57:40.623
Your face is really red.

57:43.126 --> 57:44.878
Wait, you're running a fever.

57:44.961 --> 57:46.254
Oh.

57:46.337 --> 57:48.465
What do you mean, "Oh"? Are you okay?

57:48.548 --> 57:49.924
You're burning up.

57:50.967 --> 57:52.927
Uh, I'm okay, though.

57:53.011 --> 57:54.721
You're definitely not okay.

57:54.804 --> 57:55.805
Here.

57:56.473 --> 57:57.974
I'm really okay. So take it.

57:58.057 --> 58:00.268
I just don't want you
to blame me, okay. So here.

58:00.351 --> 58:01.853
So much for trying to look cool.

58:01.936 --> 58:03.646
I said I'm really fine, just wear it.

58:03.730 --> 58:06.983
How can you get a fever when you were
only in the rain for a short time?

58:07.066 --> 58:10.320
I told you, as a senior, taking care of
your health is also an important virtue.

58:10.403 --> 58:13.072
Yeah, yeah. There you go again.

58:13.156 --> 58:14.866
Are you seriously nagging me right now?

58:14.949 --> 58:16.409
Shut up and put this on.

58:17.994 --> 58:20.663
I take back
what I said about not disliking you.

58:27.128 --> 58:30.673
He was the one
who set the mood first during that moment

58:30.757 --> 58:32.258
that rainy day.

58:32.342 --> 58:33.635
Does that mean…

58:34.219 --> 58:36.054
that you really dislike me?

58:38.640 --> 58:41.267
Or was it because of the weather?

58:41.351 --> 58:42.185
No.

58:43.520 --> 58:46.356
Or was it because
I was running a fever that day?

58:46.439 --> 58:47.440
So?

58:47.524 --> 58:50.860
Or was I
running a fever just like him?

58:50.944 --> 58:51.986
I'm pretty sure

58:52.487 --> 58:53.947
that it was because of the weather.

58:54.489 --> 58:55.657
It was unpredictable.

58:56.616 --> 58:57.867
This is good.

59:04.791 --> 59:06.376
I think I like you.

59:32.610 --> 59:35.154
Did you two
used to be close back in school?

59:36.698 --> 59:38.116
I'm not sure.

59:38.199 --> 59:41.202
I think I've always been just an observer.

59:44.455 --> 59:49.002
THE BOY, OR THE GIRL, WE LIKED THEN

01:00:12.275 --> 01:00:14.944
Ung has always been like this.

01:00:15.028 --> 01:00:18.406
His whole world would shatter
whenever Yeon-su would appear.

01:00:18.489 --> 01:00:21.743
How hard is it for you to say sorry?
I'm the one who gives in in the end.

01:00:23.453 --> 01:00:25.705
I'll do it. I'll work with Nu-a.

01:00:26.998 --> 01:00:28.291
Something more artistic…

01:00:28.374 --> 01:00:29.375
Did it just throw up?

01:00:29.459 --> 01:00:31.544
- Oh, did the camera throw up?
- Do you wanna die?

01:00:32.128 --> 01:00:33.671
I'm sorry.

01:00:33.755 --> 01:00:35.465
Let's not allow our emotions
to get in the way.
